                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Even with how old this game is I cannot stop playing it. My family and I just finished reading everything Tolkien, and when a friend heard I haven't beaten this or is sequel he demanded that I did.\r\n\r\nWhere as I have not beaten it yet, I will shortly... There is a ton to do, and its a perfect game to play if you just have 30 minutes to play sometimes... Jump in, kill a captain, finish a survival task, or collect items. The story is great, and presented well even with its age. \r\nIt's so sad to see games like this stuck in the past and then see the slop like Wolverine  coming out these days. I truly hope that someday we get back to the days of awesome games like SOM, and SOW",
